==Description==
The '''Executioner''' was a secondary narrator for the [[A Dark Tale]] and [[The Great Finale]] maps. It was the [[Executioner (Lunar Overture)|Executioner]] enemy from the [[Lunar Overture Event]].

==Appearance==
The '''Executioner''' was a plushie version of the Level 5 {{Color|Eclipse|Eclipse}} [[Executioner]]. It had a dark purple helmet with horns with blue glow inside of it, dark purple shoulder-pads, chestplate and leg padding. It had yellow button knee-pads, a purple belt and a giant yellow button on its torso. It also wore purple gloves and shoes.

The '''Executioner''' wielded a large grey and red axe.

